Bot1.Search(Llanowar Elves)
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Llanowar Elves
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Formidable Speaker.Activate(Ability: Untap another; Mox Jet)
Bot1.Pass

